  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.1: Fix stale-claim reclaim missing legacy rows — rows moved to Sending by pre-2.2.0 code have no NextAttemptOn deadline stamped and were orphaned forever; the reclaim now also recovers NULL-deadline Sending rows older than StaleClaimMinutes (by CreatedOn) back to Error for normal retry. No schema change.\n2.2.0: Atomic CAS claim of queued emails (ExecuteUpdateAsync Pending/Error -> Sending only if the row is still in the read status) so multiple worker instances can no longer double-send; stale-claim reclaim of rows left in Sending past a stamped deadline (reuses the existing NextAttemptOn column, no schema change); new RunHostedService option to gate the background worker on parked/standby instances while keeping EnqueueAsync available; configurable StaleClaimMinutes (default 10).",
